<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Campus Bus Route Optimizer</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #10B981;
            --dark: #0F172A;
            --card-bg: #1E293B;
            --text-muted: #94A3B8;
            --light: #F8FAFC;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: var(--light);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Hero Header */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        .badge {
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        p.lead {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Stats Bar */
        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin: 2.5rem 0;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Content Sections */
        section {
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--light);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            padding-left: 0.75rem;
        }

        /* Comparison Table */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #1E293B;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Tech Stack Tags */
        .tech-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .tag {
            background: #334155;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 3rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #334155;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Hero Header -->
        <header>
            <span class="badge">Academic Project Showcase</span>
            <h1>Campus Bus Route Optimizer</h1>
            <p class="lead">Rethinking campus transit through data-driven route generation, dynamic dispatching, and real-time schedule optimization.</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Stats Section -->
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">18%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Wait Time Reduced</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">12%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Fuel Saved Daily</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">10+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Bus Stops Optimized</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Problem vs Solution -->
        <section>
            <h2>Problem vs. Optimization Solution</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Current System</th>
                        <th>Optimized Approach</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Fixed loops regardless of student density</td>
                        <td>Dynamic rerouting based on class schedule peaks</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>High wait times at crowded hubs</td>
                        <td>Algorithm-driven priority dispatching</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Excess fuel consumption on empty runs</td>
                        <td>Graph shortest-path routing (Dijkstra's & GA)</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </section>

        <!-- Tech Stack -->
        <section>
            <h2>System Architecture & Tech Stack</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">Built using graph theory modeling, optimization libraries, and interactive visualization tools.</p>
            <div class="tech-tags">
                <span class="tag">Python</span>
                <span class="tag">Dijkstra's Algorithm</span>
                <span class="tag">Genetic Algorithms</span>
                <span class="tag">NetworkX</span>
                <span class="tag">Leaflet.js</span>
                <span class="tag">React</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer>
            <p>Campus Bus Route Optimizer &copy; 2026. Designed for Project Submission.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
